          "solutionSteps": [
            "Formula: $p(x) = k[x^2 - (\\text{sum})x + (\\text{product})]$.",
            "Substituting sum $=-3$ and product $=-2$:",
            "$p(x) = k[x^2 - (-3)x + (-2)] = k(x^2 + 3x - 2)$.",
            "For $k = -1$, $p(x) = -x^2 - 3x + 2$."
          ],
          "finalAnswer": "Ans: (B) $-x^2 - 3x + 2$"
